        <mxCell id="sens" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;Cảm biến&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;DHT22 · nhiệt độ, độ ẩm&lt;br&gt;BMP280 · áp suất&lt;br&gt;BH1750 · ánh sáng&lt;br&gt;YL-83 · mưa&lt;br&gt;MQ-2 · gas, khói&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="220" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esp" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;ESP32 · MicroPython&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Đọc 1 Hz, lọc median-5 + EWMA&lt;br&gt;Quy đổi ppm, điểm sương, mức mưa&lt;br&gt;10 feature, cửa sổ 10–60 s&lt;br&gt;Rule 4 cấp, hysteresis, debounce&lt;br&gt;Còi, LED, TFT dưới 1 s, chạy offline&lt;br&gt;Đệm offline flash, WDT, OTA&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="370" y="40" width="300" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="brk" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;Mosquitto broker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:6px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Xác thực user / mật khẩu&lt;br&gt;ACL theo thiết bị&lt;br&gt;LWT online / offline&lt;br&gt;Retain status, config, forecast&lt;br&gt;vku/aiot/station01/…&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="40" width="230" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
